读者笔记 · 北京青年团契 body { background: var(--parchment);
} /* —— 页面头部横幅 —— */
.page-hero { position: relative; padding: 9rem 2rem 5rem; text-align: center; overflow: hidden; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, var(--night-700) 0%, var(--night-900) 70%); color: var(--cream);
} .page-hero::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 15% 40%, rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.5), transparent), radial-gradient(1px 1px at 50% 25%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), transparent), radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 80% 50%, rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.3), transparent), radial-gradient(1px 1px at 30% 70%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), transparent);
} .page-hero::after { content: ""; position: absolute; top: -30%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 800px; height: 800px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.1) 0%, transparent 65%); animation: pulseGlow 6s ease-in-out infinite;
} .page-hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; animation: fadeUp 1s var(--ease) both;
} .breadcrumb { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
} .breadcrumb a { color: var(--text-light);
} .breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--gold-300);
} .breadcrumb .sep { color: var(--gold-600);
} .page-hero-eyebrow { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gold-300); margin-bottom: 1rem;
} .page-hero h1 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.25; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
} .page-hero h1 .accent { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-300), var(--gold-500)); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
} .page-hero-desc { font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.9; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto;
} /* —— 装饰波浪分隔 —— */
.wave-divider { display: block; width: 100%; height: 60px; background: var(--parchment); clip-path: polygon(0 100%, 100% 100%, 100% 0, 50% 60%, 0 0); margin-top: -1px;
} /* —— 介绍区 —— */
.intro-section { padding: 4rem 0 2rem;
} .intro-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem;
} .intro-text h2 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.9rem; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.4;
} .intro-text p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.9; margin-bottom: 1rem;
} .intro-text .lead { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-primary); font-style: italic; border-left: 3px solid var(--gold-400); padding-left: 1.2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
} .intro-visual { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--night-700), var(--night-900)); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
} .intro-visual::before { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: radial-gradient(1px 1px at 20% 30%, rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.6), transparent), radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 60% 50%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4), transparent), radial-gradient(1px 1px at 80% 20%, rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.5), transparent), radial-gradient(1px 1px at 40% 80%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3), transparent);
} .intro-visual-symbol { position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: center;
} .intro-visual-symbol .open-book { font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block; filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 20px rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.4));
} .intro-visual-symbol .verse { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--gold-300); max-width: 240px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 auto;
} /* —— 笔记列表区 —— */
.notes-section { padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
} .notes-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(380px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem;
} .article-card { display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: var(--cream); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm); border: 1px solid rgba(212, 160, 23, 0.1); transition: transform 0.45s var(--ease), box-shadow 0.45s var(--ease); position: relative;
} .article-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
} .article-banner { height: 200px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
} .article-banner.grace { background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 40%, rgba(74, 122, 181, 0.5) 0%, transparent 50%), linear-gradient(135deg, #0d1b2a, #1b3358, #234070);
} .article-banner.pride { background: radial-gradient(circle at 70% 30%, rgba(196, 86, 74, 0.4) 0%, transparent 50%), linear-gradient(135deg, #2a1410, #5c2a1e, #8b3a2a);
} .article-banner.walk { background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 40%, rgba(201, 162, 39, 0.4) 0%, transparent 50%), linear-gradient(135deg, #1a2a15, #3d4f35, #5C6B52);
} .article-banner.life { background: radial-gradient(circle at 40% 50%, rgba(139, 90, 43, 0.4) 0%, transparent 50%), linear-gradient(135deg, #1f1a10, #4a3520, #7a5530);
} .article-banner.repent { background: radial-gradient(circle at 60% 40%, rgba(90, 60, 110, 0.4) 0%, transparent 50%), linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1020, #3d2a50, #5C4A7A);
} .article-banner .banner-icon { position: relative; z-index: 1; text-align: center;
} .article-banner .banner-icon .glyph { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 700; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
} .article-banner .banner-icon .glyph-cn { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--gold-300); letter-spacing: 0.15em;
} .article-banner::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 120%, rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);
} /* 漂浮装饰 */
.article-banner .float-dot { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(244, 213, 141, 0.3); animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
} .article-banner .float-dot:nth-child(1) { width: 8px; height: 8px; top: 20%; left: 15%; animation-delay: 0s;
}
.article-banner .float-dot:nth-child(2) { width: 5px; height: 5px; top: 60%; left: 80%; animation-delay: 1s;
}
.article-banner .float-dot:nth-child(3) { width: 6px; height: 6px; top: 75%; left: 25%; animation-delay: 2s;
} .article-body { padding: 2rem; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
} .article-tags { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
} .article-tag { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: var(--radius-full); letter-spacing: 0.05em;
} .article-tag.theme { background: rgba(212, 160, 23, 0.12); color: var(--gold-600);
} .article-tag.book { background: rgba(74, 122, 181, 0.1); color: var(--accent-blue);
} .article-body h3 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.45rem; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.4; transition: color 0.3s var(--ease);
} .article-card:hover .article-body h3 { color: var(--gold-600);
} .article-excerpt { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.8; flex: 1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
} .article-footer { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--parchment-dark);
} .article-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted);
} .article-meta .meta-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem;
} .article-read-btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.4rem; font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--gold-600); padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem; border-radius: var(--radius-full); border: 1.5px solid var(--gold-400); transition: all 0.35s var(--ease);
} .article-card:hover .article-read-btn { background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-400), var(--gold-500)); color: var(--night-900); gap: 0.6rem;
} /* —— 邀请区 —— */
.invite-section { padding: 4rem 0; background: var(--parchment-dark);
} .invite-card { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; text-align: center;
} .invite-card h2 { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 1.8rem; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 1rem;
} .invite-card p { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.9; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 2rem;
} /* —— 响应式 —— */
@media (max-width: 860px) { .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; } .intro-visual { max-width: 460px; margin: 0 auto; }
} @media (max-width: 600px) { .page-hero { padding: 7rem 1.2rem 3.5rem; } .notes-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 0 1.2rem; } .article-body { padding: 1.5rem; }
} 首页 / 读者笔记 Reader's Notes 读者笔记 圣经不只是一本供我们阅读的书，更是一面映照生命的镜子。 这里收录读者在神话语光照下的领受、省思与见证， 愿每一篇文字都成为彼此同奔天路的勉励。 "我将你的话藏在心里，免得我得罪你。" —— 诗篇 119:11 为什么要有读者笔记？ 读经不只是知识的累积，更是生命与神话语的真实相遇。当我们安静在主面前，圣灵常常借着某一段经文光照我们的内心——有时是安慰，有时是责备，有时是呼召。 读者笔记，正是把这些转瞬即逝的光照记录下来。它不是学术注释，而是一个个普通信徒在真理中被更新的真实见证。约拿在鱼腹中的祷告、哈曼在骄傲中的沉沦、以诺与神同行的三百年、雅各瘸腿中的看见、参孙跌倒后的归回，都不只是古老的故事，更是对我们今日生命的提醒。 愿你在这里找到共鸣，也被激励，在自己的读经旅程中写下属于你的篇章。 📖 "你的言语一解开就发出亮光使愚人通达。"—— 诗篇 119:130 笔记目录 全部读者笔记 点击任意一篇，进入更深的学习与反思。 <div class="notes-list"> <!-- 约拿的故事 --> <a href="./grace_article.html" class="article-card reveal reveal-delay-1"> <div class="article-banner grace"> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <div class="banner-icon"> <span class="glyph">Jonah</span> <span class="glyph-cn">约 拿</span> </div> </div> <div class="article-body"> <div class="article-tags"> <span class="article-tag theme">恩典</span> <span class="article-tag book">约拿书</span> </div> <h3>约拿的故事</h3> <p class="article-excerpt"> 从他施的船票到尼尼微的宣告，从鱼腹中的呼求到蓖麻树下的怒气。约拿的一生是一部恩典的纪录片——神的恩典越过先知的悖逆，也越过仇敌的恶行，到达每一个愿意回转的灵魂。 </p> <div class="article-footer"> <div class="article-meta"> <span class="meta-item">📜 约拿书 1-4 章</span> <span class="meta-item">✍️ 恩典专题</span> </div> <span class="article-read-btn">阅读全文 →</span> </div> </div> </a> <!-- 哈曼最大的敌人不是末底改 --> <a href="./pride_article.html" class="article-card reveal reveal-delay-2"> <div class="article-banner pride"> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <div class="banner-icon"> <span class="glyph">Haman</span> <span class="glyph-cn">哈 曼</span> </div> </div> <div class="article-body"> <div class="article-tags"> <span class="article-tag theme">骄傲</span> <span class="article-tag book">以斯帖记</span> </div> <h3>哈曼最大的敌人不是末底改</h3> <p class="article-excerpt"> 哈曼以为是末底改的不跪不拜毁了他，却不知真正的敌人藏在自己心里。那五丈高的木架，不是为末底改预备的，而是为哈曼自己的骄傲预备的。骄傲在败坏以先，狂心在跌倒之前。 </p> <div class="article-footer"> <div class="article-meta"> <span class="meta-item">📜 以斯帖记 3-7 章</span> <span class="meta-item">✍️ 骄傲专题</span> </div> <span class="article-read-btn">阅读全文 →</span> </div> </div> </a> <!-- 以诺与神同行三百年 --> <a href="./enoch_article.html" class="article-card reveal reveal-delay-3"> <div class="article-banner walk"> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <div class="banner-icon"> <span class="glyph">Enoch</span> <span class="glyph-cn">以 诺</span> </div> </div> <div class="article-body"> <div class="article-tags"> <span class="article-tag theme">同行</span> <span class="article-tag book">创世记</span> </div> <h3>以诺与神同行三百年</h3> <p class="article-excerpt"> 他没有行过惊天动地的神迹，没有率领千军万马，没有写下一卷书。但圣经说，他与神同行三百年，神将他取去，他就不在世了。这是普通人最值得羡慕的人生——与神同行的生命。 </p> <div class="article-footer"> <div class="article-meta"> <span class="meta-item">📜 创世记 5:21-24</span> <span class="meta-item">✍️ 同行专题</span> </div> <span class="article-read-btn">阅读全文 →</span> </div> </div> </a> <!-- 雅各的瘸腿 --> <a href="./jacob_article.html" class="article-card reveal reveal-delay-4"> <div class="article-banner life"> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <div class="banner-icon"> <span class="glyph">Jacob</span> <span class="glyph-cn">雅 各</span> </div> </div> <div class="article-body"> <div class="article-tags"> <span class="article-tag theme">生命</span> <span class="article-tag book">创世记</span> </div> <h3>雅各的瘸腿</h3> <p class="article-excerpt"> 至高者既然要赐福给雅各，为什么还要让他瘸腿？毗努伊勒的那一夜，神没有给新方法，只摸了他的大腿窝。因为真正要处理的，不是外面的难处，是里面那个不肯放下自己的生命。 </p> <div class="article-footer"> <div class="article-meta"> <span class="meta-item">📜 创世记 32:22-32</span> <span class="meta-item">✍️ 生命专题</span> </div> <span class="article-read-btn">阅读全文 →</span> </div> </div> </a> <!-- 参孙最大的敌人不是大利拉 --> <a href="./samson_article.html" class="article-card reveal reveal-delay-5"> <div class="article-banner repent"> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <span class="float-dot"></span> <div class="banner-icon"> <span class="glyph">Samson</span> <span class="glyph-cn">参 孙</span> </div> </div> <div class="article-body"> <div class="article-tags"> <span class="article-tag theme">悔改</span> <span class="article-tag book">士师记</span> </div> <h3>参孙最大的敌人不是大利拉</h3> <p class="article-excerpt"> 罪很少是突然把人拖垮的。第一次妥协还会害怕，第二次就松了，第三次警觉开始变弱。参孙的问题不是从大利拉开始的，她只是把里面早已存在的问题，彻底暴露了出来。 </p> <div class="article-footer"> <div class="article-meta"> <span class="meta-item">📜 士师记 13-16 章</span> <span class="meta-item">✍️ 悔改专题</span> </div> <span class="article-read-btn">阅读全文 →</span> </div> </div> </a>
</div> 你的故事，也可以被记录 神的话语今日仍然说话。如果你在某段经文中领受了光照、安慰或提醒， 欢迎将它整理成笔记，与更多的弟兄姊妹分享。愿我们一同在真理中被建立。 返回首页探索更多 → 北京青年团契 扎根真理、践行大爱、同奔天路。 愿这里成为你在北京遇见属灵家人的地方。 首页 关于我们 启示录闯关 加入我们 读者笔记 有声频道 读圣经 约拿的故事 哈曼最大的敌人 以诺与神同行 雅各的瘸腿 参孙与大利拉 © 2026 北京青年团契 · 扎根真理、践行大爱、同奔天路
